# Primary HMM (main text): Gaussian HMM on the first 25 principal components
# (HMM-MAR options.pca = 25), K = 3. Passed the calibrated confirmation of the
# step 5 screen candidate (step 6b). Chosen by the PI on 27 Oct 2026 (provenance
# D33; hmm_null/MODEL_SELECTION_RULE.md amendment 1; FIT_SELECTION_RULE.md
# amendment 1). hmm_config.m uses this model when no HMM_K / HMM_LOWRANK /
# HMM_PCA is set; hmm_py and hmm_occupancy_drift.py do the same; the job scripts
# read it through hipergator_tests/reported_model.sh primary.
# Change only by a dated amendment to FIT_SELECTION_RULE.md, never after its ten
# fits have started (the array job copies this file into the fits folder and
# stops if it changes).
# Format: NAME=integer, one per line; # starts a comment line.
HMM_K=3
HMM_LOWRANK=0
HMM_PCA=25
